      "text": "SARCOPTERYGII\n          |\n          +-- Coelacanth\n          +-- Rhipidistia\n                |\n                +-- Lungfish (sister to tetrapods)\n                +-- TETRAPODA (4 limbs)\n                       |\n                       +-- AMPHIBIA (water-dependent)\n                       +-- AMNIOTA (reptiles, birds, mammals)"
    },
